                    overline="Contact DXP AI"
                    heading="We&apos;d Love to Hear from You"
                    lead="Our solutions team typically responds within 1 business day. All inquiries are handled with full confidentiality."
                    text="&lt;h3&gt;Request a Product Demo&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;See DXP AI in action with a personalized walkthrough from one of our platform architects. We&apos;ll tailor the demo to your industry and specific use cases.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Start a Free Trial&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get 30-day access to the full DXP AI Starter or Professional platform &#8212; no credit card required. Our onboarding team will guide you every step of the way.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Talk to Sales&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have questions about pricing, enterprise contracts, or custom implementation? Our sales team will work with you to find the right solution.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Partnership Inquiries&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Interested in becoming a DXP AI technology or implementation partner? We&apos;d love to explore how we can work together.&lt;/p&gt;"
                    sidebarTitle="Contact Details"
                    sidebarText="&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ZensAI / DXP AI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br/&gt;A Zensar Technologies Product&lt;br/&gt;Pune, India&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales:&lt;/strong&gt; sales@dxp-ai.com&lt;br/&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support:&lt;/strong&gt; support@dxp-ai.com&lt;br/&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partnerships:&lt;/strong&gt; partners@dxp-ai.com&lt;/p&gt;"
